# Colorectal Cancer Survival Prediction using Machine Learning

## Project Overview

This project predicts colorectal cancer survival status using Machine Learning techniques. The project includes data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis, visualization, feature engineering, and predictive modeling using Logistic Regression.

---

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Jupyter Notebook

---

## Machine Learning Algorithm

- Logistic Regression

---

## Features Implemented

- Data preprocessing
- Duplicate removal
- Categorical encoding
- Correlation heatmap
- Data visualization
- Feature scaling
- Train-test split
- Logistic Regression model
- Confusion matrix
- Classification report

---

## Dataset Information

The dataset contains patient-related information such as:
- Age
- Gender
- Tumor characteristics
- Treatment details
- Medical history
- Survival status

Target Variable:
- Survival_Status

